Moves: In an L-shape — two squares in one direction, then one square to the
side; can jump over pieces.  When it’s strong:   • Great in closed
positions where other pieces are blocked.   • Very strong on outposts,
especially in the center.   • In endgames, it can be a bit slow compared to
bishops.  Value: About 3 pawns.}  *

